type: dataset
title: "The Price of a Gigabyte: Residential Proxy Prices 2019–2026"
abstract: "Dated residential proxy prices per GB for 12 providers, read from their own pricing pages (live on 2 October 2026) and from Wayback Machine captures back to 2019, plus a monthly GB Price Index (July 2024 = 100)."
